---
{
  title: "remainder"
}
---
### NAME

    remainder() - Calculates the remainder of `a` divided by `b`.

### SYNOPSIS

    varargs float remainder( mixed a, mixed b );

### DESCRIPTION

    Calculates the remainder of `a` divided by `b`.

### PARAMETERS

    a  (mixed)
       The dividend.

    b  (mixed)
       The divisor.

### RETURN VALUES

    (float) The floored remainder of `a` divided by `b`.
